Note on third-party material
----------------------------
This repository does not redistribute source code or PDFs of the analysed
third-party repositories, nor PDFs of the cited papers. Analysed repositories
are fetched at reproduction time from their public origins and are used under
their own licences, which are recorded per repository in the screening tables.
The official iSys LaTeX template files (paper/sbc2025.cls, paper/sectsty.sty,
paper/aas_macros.sty, paper/apalike-sol.bst) are redistributed here only as the
venue's own submission template, as the journal intends.
